  "uncertainty": "The dossier identifies Pacifica Foundation, Inc. as KPFA's FCC licensee and operator, with no ownership links above that nonprofit. It does not establish a controlling natural person or family. The October 17, 2024 Pacifica National Board minutes identify “Stephanie Wells, Executive Director (P)” (https://kpftx.org/archives/pnb/pnb241017/pnb241017_9018_minutes.pdf), but do not establish that she remained executive director on October 4, 2026. Accordingly, the current executive director is not established. The dossier contains no evidence of a later licensee change, but does not provide an explicitly dated October 2026 ownership verification."
